This database is HISTORY, not the fund.

The fund moved to the phone on 2026-09-10: 55 events exported, transferred and
imported on device, every regenerated hash compared against the exported one.
This file is a snapshot at that moment and does not move again.

The CLI that read it was deleted at 5.10 the same day, along with the whole
desktop surface. Recovering it means checking out a commit from before that.

Do not create a second ledger here. The chain is append-only and a fork cannot
be merged - an import compares every hash and refuses a mismatch by design.
